      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The silence you crave is not a solution but the empty room where the genuine part of you will finally be heard without the pressure of performance.\nConsider that ghosts fade only when the living refuse to follow them out, and staying may be the only way the rest of you can actually come back.\nReach for a connection where you are allowed to be incomplete instead of hiding the truth that will never be enough.",
